prompt:
Implement a 3D mesh deformation tool using Three.js. Load the Corset.glb model, allowing users to click and drag to push or pull the model's surface vertices.

[Three.js Import Method (Must Be Followed Strictly)]
Use the following import map in <head>, and import via ES Modules in <script type="module">:
<script type="importmap">
{ "imports": {
    "three": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/build/three.module.js",
    "three/addons/": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/examples/jsm/"
} }
</script>
<script type="module">
import * as THREE from 'three';
import { GLTFLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js';
import { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';
// Write your code here
</script>

[Model Loading]
(1) Use GLTFLoader to load assets/Corset.glb;
(2) Center the model and scale it appropriately;

[Deformation Interaction]
(3) When the model surface is clicked with the left mouse button, use Raycaster to obtain the intersection point;
(4) Displace all vertices within the brush radius centered on the intersection point along the normal direction;
(5) The displacement amount must be inversely related to the distance from the center (Gaussian falloff);
(6) Clicking pushes outward by default (protrusion); hold Shift to push inward (indentation);

[Brush Controls]
(7) Brush size slider (id="brushSize", range 0.05-0.5, default 0.15);
(8) Deformation strength slider (id="strength", range 0.01-0.1, default 0.03);

[Undo/Reset]
(9) The "Undo" button (id="undoBtn") undoes the most recent deformation;
(10) The "Reset" button (id="resetBtn") restores the original model;
(11) The Undo stack has a maximum depth of 20;

[OrbitControls]
(12) Support rotating the view (disable orbit controls during deformation and restore them after release);

[HUD Display]
(13) HUD in the upper-left corner:
  - Deformation count (id="deformCount")
  - Brush size (id="brushValue")
  - Undo stack size (id="undoSize")

[State Exposure (Required)]
Update window.__3D_STATE__ every frame:
  - modelLoaded: boolean
  - deformCount: number
  - brushSize: number
  - strength: number
  - undoStackSize: number
  - vertexCount: number

Output a single standalone HTML file.
